        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:issue"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n4. The common facts in both the cases are as under:-\ni. Both the appellants sustained injuries in the course of same accident that occurred on 24.02.2019."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4d004458e34f4c8190a903841cdc1765_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Though the appellant projected that he was earning Rs.14,000/- per month, the NC: 2024:KHC:47379 evidence produced by himself goes to show that he was drawing consolidated pay of Rs.10,000/- per month."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "23064a495c2a40a78785c6add189459b_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore this Court does not find any grounds to interfere with the findings given by the tribunal, that the monthly income of the appellant is required to be considered as Rs.10,000/- per month."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f45a38bbba4841a78b87d6635b54c58e_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "9. It is not in dispute that the appellant underwent surgery during the course of treatment."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "53025dd6ee824c2cbc8393c90ef6637f_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Though PW-3 stated that the disability in respect of particular limb is 48% and in respect of whole body is 16%, the tribunal took the disability in respect of whole body as 10%."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "61c9cddfca0e4d7795065770b59d4aac_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The assessment made by the tribunal is valid."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6e06e747d7c14d76835dc60979216788_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore no interference in that regard is required."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c922dc1beb2d4bdb963561840ad35038_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n10. By all the evidence that is brought on record the appellant succeed in establishing that he took treatment as inpatient from 24.02.2019 to 08.03.2019."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c821093cff7c410da3b89615eaba7d67_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "11. Having considered the nature of injuries sustained, the surgery underwent and the treatment taken, this Court is of the view that the appellant would not have attended his normal pursuits atleast for a period of 3 months."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5899f5cbd1d4487e83939b11eecc89a8_36",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, the tribunal awarded a sum of Rs.10,000/- only under the head 'loss of NC: 2024:KHC:47379 earning during laid up period'."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "02a330c3ba3e4e45873edcbdcb80d4ba_37",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Also the tribunal awarded a sum of Rs.30,000/- only under the head 'pain and suffering'."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4f3f4876982f43989cc49190accff0bf_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However having considered the nature of injuries sustained and the treatment taken and also the disability with which the appellant is left with, this Court is of the view that such sum is disproportionate to the injury sustained."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9d6c14e4211748e4a32218b878a99e2c_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nSri Niteenpaul Malagi vs Tata Aig General Insurance Co Ltd on 21 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/71810683/\n4 12. Having considered these aspects, this Court is of the view that globally a sum of Rs.75,000/- is re"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e8ab1c8e4d764951a190c59d2ba7975f_40",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "13. Therefore this Court holds that the appellant is entitled to a sum of Rs.75,000/-in addition to the sum that is awarded by the tribunal."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "362f32acaf2848dab051a81ee9827121_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
