        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "14. The appellant in this case has sustained right distal radius fracture and underwent surgery for the said injury as per the material available on record."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6dbaac5714084ababd92aad3ba8639f6_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "PW -3 assessed the disability in respect of upper limb as 38% and in respect of whole body NC: 2024:KHC:47379 as 12.66%."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bb750788de7742559bb13e3867f43593_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However,\nconsidering the totality of evidence that is brought on record, the tribunal took the disability in respect of whole body as 8% which is justifiable."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2a7ee8094bea40d0adf433661661b37f_45",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Through the evidence produced, the appellant established that he incurred a sum of Rs.1,12,135/- for treatment and the tribunal indeed awarded the said amount."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "de6ecb1a3ce545c8b2bf56c566846204_46",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Sofaras loss of income during laid up period is concerned, the tribunal awarded a sum of Rs.10,000/- only under the said head."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "81472b15fad7483f8ac646dcdb923aca_47",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However having considered the nature of injuries sustained, this Court is of the view that the appellant would have taken bed rest atleast for a period of 3 months."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "01a158e31e934ba499d0464df9eb4780_48",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Also the tribunal awarded a sum of Rs.20,000/- only under the head pain and suffering."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "100fcbdb54394f849b9bad4bf1df681a_49",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As rightly submitted by learned counsel for the appellant such amount is grossly low."
